 fractions:[['Equivalence and reference quantities','Equivalent fractions express the same number. Fractions of different-sized wholes can still represent different physical amounts, so context matters.'],['Build a counterexample','Draw one half of a small rectangle and one quarter of a much larger rectangle. Could the quarter be the larger area? Explain your assumptions.']]
